peer_review_rounds.author_response:
We thank Reviewer 1 for the constructive comments. Addressing their comments has strengthened our manuscript. Below we outline how we have addressed their general and specific comments (see blue-coloured text). Specifically in this revision, we have rerun several analyses to:
1. improved data comparability with existing studies;
2. re-calculated our estimate of peatland area and associated carbon emissions for Brunei Darussalam;
3. identified and mapped locations where mangroves and peatlands appear to overlap, and re-calculated their associated emissions;
4. provided satellite image composites for land cover map verification;
5. provided study limitations sub-section to the Methods section;
6. stored dataset resulted from this study in public repository;
7. provided codes to generate land use change map;
8. changed the title.
Further point by point responses are provided below.
